# Build outputs assembled by scripts/build-package.sh.
#
# In the upstream development repository these are regenerated on demand and are
# therefore ignored. In this packaged snapshot they are SHIPPED artifacts: the
# CLI resolves its daemon and UI bundles from these directories, so ignoring them
# would produce a repository that cannot run without a rebuild. They are listed
# in PACKAGE-MANIFEST.json and covered by SHA256SUMS.
#
# Regenerate with: npm run build:package

# No ignore rules here on purpose.
